Subject: [PATCH 14/32] manual: use @ONLINE_ROOT@ for the WMM manual

@ONLINE_PLUG@ is not replaced in Manual::Launch, so the WMM entry gave a
broken link. Use @ONLINE_ROOT@ like the other entries, as on master.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 libs/manual/src/manual.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libs/manual/src/manual.cpp b/libs/manual/src/manual.cpp
index e5b8586aa..ed0c2ad46 100644
--- a/libs/manual/src/manual.cpp
+++ b/libs/manual/src/manual.cpp
@@ -47,7 +47,7 @@ static const std::unordered_map<std::string, std::string> kOnlineEntries = {
   {"Toc", "@ONLINE_ROOT@/index.html"},
   {"Chartdldr",
      "@ONLINE_ROOT@/chartdldr/index.html"},
-  {"Wmm",  "@ONLINE_PLUG@/wmm/index.html"},
+  {"Wmm",  "@ONLINE_ROOT@/wmm/index.html"},
   {"Dashboard", "@ONLINE_ROOT@/dashboard/index.html"},
   {"Grib", "@ONLINE_ROOT@/grib/index.html"},
   {"Hotkeys",
